<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 http://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>
    <groupId>com.chua</groupId>
    <artifactId>utils-support-native-parent</artifactId>
    <version>4.0.0.42</version>
    <packaging>pom</packaging>
    <description>预编译 native 二进制库（Rust cdylib），独立于 Java 代码分发</description>

    <properties>
        <project.build.sourceEncoding>UTF-8</project.build.sourceEncoding>
    </properties>

    <modules>
        <module>utils-support-native-ffmpeg</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-sqlite</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-datarecovery</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-video-processor</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-metrics</module>
    <module>utils-support-native-filesearch</module>
    <module>utils-support-native-filesearch-java8</module>
    <module>utils-support-native-filestorage</module>
    <module>utils-support-native-smb</module>
    <module>utils-support-native-video-codec</module>
    <module>utils-support-native-headless</module>
    <module>utils-support-native-cuda</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-nmap</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-sysinformer</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-sysinformer-java8</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-needle</module>
        <module>utils-support-native-libjpeg-turbo</module>
</modules>

    <repositories>
        <repository>
            <id>2676178-release-jmLEdB</id>
            <name>Aliyun Packages Release</name>
            <url>https://packages.aliyun.com/6a62fa1d287d37b037a68ee8/maven/2676178-release-jmledb</url>
            <releases><enabled>true</enabled></releases>
            <snapshots><enabled>false</enabled></snapshots>
        </repository>
        <repository>
            <id>2676178-snapshot-FwAJpk</id>
            <name>Aliyun Packages Snapshot</name>
            <url>https://packages.aliyun.com/6a62fa1d287d37b037a68ee8/maven/2676178-snapshot-fwajpk</url>
            <releases><enabled>true</enabled></releases>
            <snapshots><enabled>true</enabled></snapshots>
        </repository>
        <!--
          GitHub Packages：`utils-support-common-starter` 等 com.chua 构件的**真实来源**。

          为什么必须显式声明在这里：本 pom 原来只声明了上面两个 aliyun 仓库，
          于是解析 `com.chua:*` 时 Maven **只去 aliyun**，而 aliyun 对
          `utils-support-common-starter:4.0.0.42` 返回 **404**（带凭据也是 404，
          不是 401 —— 说明凭据被接受、路径不存在）。

          那个构件声明在 `utils-support-parent-starter-4.0.0.42.pom` 里，
          但 repository 声明**不会**经由「依赖的依赖」传递到本项目，
          所以本项目自己必须声明一次。

          **只配 server 凭据而不声明 repository 是无效的** —— server 只提供
          认证信息，不告诉 Maven 去哪里找。2026-10-03 在 CI 上正是踩了这个：
          secrets 配齐了、凭据也正确，但构建仍报「找不到构件」。
        -->
        <repository>
            <id>github-resource</id>
            <name>GitHub Packages (utils-support-resource-parent)</name>
            <url>https://maven.pkg.github.com/CHTK001/utils-support-resource-parent</url>
            <releases><enabled>true</enabled></releases>
            <snapshots><enabled>true</enabled></snapshots>
        </repository>
    </repositories>

    <distributionManagement>
        <repository>
            <id>2676178-release-jmLEdB</id>
            <name>Aliyun Packages Release</name>
            <url>https://packages.aliyun.com/6a62fa1d287d37b037a68ee8/maven/2676178-release-jmledb</url>
        </repository>
        <snapshotRepository>
            <id>2676178-snapshot-FwAJpk</id>
            <name>Aliyun Packages Snapshot</name>
            <url>https://packages.aliyun.com/6a62fa1d287d37b037a68ee8/maven/2676178-snapshot-fwajpk</url>
        </snapshotRepository>
    </distributionManagement>
</project>


